diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index 73576419d..815d1967e 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -315,12 +315,12 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - New **Music category**: allows to play **~1750 audio scripts** (i.e. files) in Sevopedia, notably for **Techs**, **Leaders**, **Eras**, **Civilizations**, and many other. **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to Sevopedia Music. Approach broadly similar to that of Sevopedia Movies. **Search bar support** and **widening** allows to find desired tracks. Note: there are **multiple sounds in an item** for each civilization sound item, so **replay many times the same item to hear all civilization sounds**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Music)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-092-music-category-1750-audio-scripts-playable-in-sevopedia).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5673+) New **Expanded Text Panels** so History/Background **text** (e.g. of the Viking unit that is long and requires scrolling to be seen or of the Great General Unit (that includes uniquenames that require scrolling to be scanned quickly)) easier to read, with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. It occupies the whole item's page but **preserves the rest of the sevopedia page display** (footer, header, item bar and category bar) for easy browsing. This allows to **browse other category items** (e.g., other leaders from sevopedia leader's item bar) **without having to close and reopen expanded view** everytime item is changed (e.g. when clicking on another leader). Added as an optional helper shared accross all eligible categories (main code in [_sevopedia_helpers.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/_sevopedia_helpers.py)). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded text panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-093-expanded-text-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5674+) New **Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g. Animation) Panels** similarly so **animations** (e.g. of the Viking unit) can be viewed **maximized** (i.e. using all the item's page), with **EXPAND**, **RELOAD** (so e.g. the animation can be **reloaded** (e.g., to change unit color, reset animation, reset camera position/auto-rotation movement) **without having to exit and reopen expanded view**), and **CLOSE** buttons. Applied for eligible categories: Bonuses, Improvements, Units ("Un.List"), Buildings ("Buildings", "N.Wond.", "W.Wond"). See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded Content (Non-text; e.g., Animation) Panels)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-094-expanded-content-non-text-eg-animation-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5677+) New **Expanded leaderhead panel** similarly with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** button, and **leaderhead animation** with **expanded height and scaling width** (percentage of height **to maximize display of the full leaderhead** (because a suboptimal width/height ratio causes animation to show less of the leaderhead)), and leaderhead **attitude and action buttons** synchronized with the ones in sevopedia leader. See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded leaderhead panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-095-expanded-leaderhead-panel).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5677+) New **Expanded leaderhead panel** similarly with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** button, and **leaderhead animation** with **expanded height and scaling width** (percentage of height **to maximize display of the full leaderhead** (because a suboptimal width/height ratio causes animation to show less of the leaderhead)), and leaderhead **attitude**, **action**, and (if set) **leaderhead art era buttons** synchronized with the ones in sevopedia leader. See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded leaderhead panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-095-expanded-leaderhead-panel).
 - Added a new **Sevopedia Builds** category (e.g. **"Remove Jungle"**, **Chop Down a Forest**, **"Build a Road"**, **"Create a Farm"**) distinct from Sevopedia Improvements, notably with **FeatureStruct** panels and **mod-agnostic new Civilopedia blurbs-based Background panel** (added the new XML field `Civilopedia`> to BuildInfos). Also added them to **Sevopedia Index** as **clickable entries with buttons**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Builds)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-040-builds-category-eg-remove-jungle-build-road-create-a-farm).
 - Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.
 - Sevopedia — Terrain: add new **Peak** add **Hill** entries (they were previously hidden in Base AdvCiv). Even though they technically are plot types, adding them helps show some information specific to these "terrains".
 - Sevopedia — Civilizations: Add **cities panel**. Add optional **grouping by Art style** (e.g. European, Asian).
-- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly) and **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree). On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5529+) Moved **BACK/NEXT/EXIT** buttons (in the **footer**) to **the left of the AI Personality Panel** so they are clickable despite intentional vertical overflow of the AI Personality Panel (to maximize usable space and show more rows/fields). Note: **AI Personality Panel categories' organization** is adjusted depending on **vertical room** (**resolutionY**); e.g., since higher resolutions like 1440p have more vertical room that allows to show categories like ACL-related categories (that are not visible at 1080p), we optimize this further by moving **No War At** from `middle_categories` to `left_categories` so the middle column has enough room to fully show ACL-related categories.
+- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly), **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree), and (if set) **leaderhead art era buttons**. On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5529+) Moved **BACK/NEXT/EXIT** buttons (in the **footer**) to **the left of the AI Personality Panel** so they are clickable despite intentional vertical overflow of the AI Personality Panel (to maximize usable space and show more rows/fields). Note: **AI Personality Panel categories' organization** is adjusted depending on **vertical room** (**resolutionY**); e.g., since higher resolutions like 1440p have more vertical room that allows to show categories like ACL-related categories (that are not visible at 1080p), we optimize this further by moving **No War At** from `middle_categories` to `left_categories` so the middle column has enough room to fully show ACL-related categories.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5512+) Also make **item bar shorter** with a **per font size tunable width** to accommodate the **AI Personality panel wider columns when text is upscaled**. Note: this applied **only for lower resolutions**, because higher resolutions have enough width to accomodate an enlarged AI Personality Panel when text is upscaled, so there is no need to reduce item bar width in Sevopedia Leader to accomodate it.
 - Sevopedia — Concepts (`ConceptInfos`) (placed under the "Outdated" *Sevopedia category*): added reference entries — e.g. `concept_rivers`, `concept_global_warming`, `concept_customization`. **"Outdated" is a Sevopedia category label** we use for pages **not maintained** to match AdvCiv-SAS rules; these exist for general Civ4 background and UI reuse. See: [Concepts (Outdated)](/README.md#concepts-as-of-now-in-the-outdated-sevopedia-category).
 - Sevopedia — Mods Infos (`NewConceptInfos`): Added **Mods Infos** (e.g., K-Mod, AdvCiv, AdvCiv-SAS). Added **Legend items** showing the legend (e.g., for the Info Screen's new Score Tab; for the Sevopedia Leader's AI Personality Panel, (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5509+) Sevopedia Categories, abbreviation meaning (e.g., for numTxt `+50/-75` or `InC`; for the AI Personality Panel `T.W Likely -> getMaxWarRand` or `Build Unit % -> getBuildUnitProb`)), with `(Inverted)` information; for Sevopedia Speeds. See also: [README.md (Legends)](/README.md#legends).

